<p>A vicious finishing strike that deals <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">200%, 233%, 259%, 280%, 300%</acronym> damage increased by 20% per combo point you have up to a max of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">400%, 467%, 518%, 561%, 600%.</acronym> If the target ends up with low enough life (&lt;20%), it might be instantly killed.</p><p>Killing a target with Haymaker will instantly restore <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4%, 7%, 9%, 11%, 13%</acronym> to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 16%, 17%, 18%, 20%</acronym> of your maximum stamina, depending on the amount of combo points you've accumulated.</p><p>Using this talent removes your combo points.</p>